WEBVTT

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.190
We've passed the six month training course,

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:07.330
and the day when we can take our seats in the Goddess Assistance Office

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.570
as regular staff members has finally arrived.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:13.840
Now we can catch up with our admired Belldandy-senpai and overtake her.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:15.350
I'm so excited!

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:16.820
Maybe we'll have a job request soon!

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:19.760
When the first job request comes, let's answer it together.

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:20.500
Yeah!

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:25.540
It's a job request! Answer it, Saga.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:26.760
W-What are you saying?

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.000
Didn't we agree to answer together when a job request came?

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.640
Hey, what are you doing, you two?

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:31.510
Hurry up and answer it.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:35.590
This office's motto is "Fast response and service."

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:37.860
You learned that during the training course, right?

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:39.890
Then let's both answer it at the same time.

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:40.600
Understood.

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:46.330
Yes.

00:00:46.330 --> 00:00:48.730
This is the Goddess Assistance Office.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:51.530
Goddess Assistance Office?

