00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:48.990
Time to eat!

00:02:48.990 --> 00:02:50.140
Thanks for the meal!

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:53.440
You should say those words of gratitude during the meal.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:57.360
Congratulations on being inaugurated into the Goddess Assistance Office.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.470
Right...

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:01.780
To be honest, we came here because we have a favor to ask of you, Senpai.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:06.210
We had our debut in the Goddess Assistance Office yesterday.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.410
It's good that a job request came immediately,

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:10.880
but the job's subject matter is a problem.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:16.610
It's a super hard job for us because we don't have any love experience in the Heavens.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:21.130
So we came here hoping that someone so experienced with Earth, like yourself,

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.950
might know a way to fulfill the request, Belldandy-senpai.

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:24.720
That's right.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:26.710
Thank you very much.

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:29.430
You can help with a job?

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:35.020
New Goddesses can seek help with jobs that have a high degree of difficulty.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:38.750
We thought that you could certainly help us,

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.200
since you've fulfilled so many wishes on Earth.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.320
Please help us out on this one!

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.490
Understood.

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:51.080
I'm coming.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:55.740
Who are you?

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:59.630
This is Yuuki's room.

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.630
Yuuki, you have a visitor.

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:04.800
Pardon the intrusion.

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:08.760
So you really came...

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:11.500
She said that she has some business with you.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.490
Oh, she's my friend's sister.

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:16.810
I'm struggling in English, so I asked her to tutor me.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:20.180
It's all right, but tell me in advance next time.

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:22.400
Please take good care of him.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.420
Okay.

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:27.500
Nice to meet you.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:31.750
I'm Belldandy from the Goddess Assistance Office.

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:32.860
Nice to meet you.

00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:35.290
I'm Shimano Yuuki.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:39.550
I was told by those two that they'd send an excellent regular staff member.

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:44.220
Due to the special circumstances I became the agent for this job.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:48.210
So it's true that you can fulfill my wish, then?

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.070
Yes.

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:51.600
However you can have only one wish.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.900
You won't laugh?

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.080
I won't.

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:56.140
I see.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:05:00.670
You see, there is this one amazing senior at my high school.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:01.680
Yes.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:05.350
I can't help but think about her every day.

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:09.710
She looked so cool when I saw her at the cultural festival last year,

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:13.880
and somehow I felt her capture my heart all of a sudden.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:18.580
Since that time I've dreamed of talking with Mariko-san, so I got a guitar.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.790
I was doing my best to practice.

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:25.170
I thought that we might be able to talk even just a bit about our hobby,

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:29.240
but she's always been very popular, so I can't get any closer to her.

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:35.480
I joined the club, but my skills aren't that good yet, and I can't attract Mariko-san's attention.

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.920
I used to always behave timidly,

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.480
but I haven't felt anything like this until now.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:44.940
When I was thinking of a way to tell her about my feelings,

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:47.820
I was connected with the Goddess Assistance Office.

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:52.170
So we just have to find a method to tell Mariko-san your feelings, right?

00:05:52.170 --> 00:05:53.990
Yes! That's my wish!

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:55.120
Understood.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:58.450
As an agent, I accept your wish.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.400
It's accessing!

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:02.800
She's been established as agent!

00:06:07.330 --> 00:06:09.550
Your wish has been accepted.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:18.520
I'm just an agent so the power I can use is limited, but I'll help fulfill your wish.

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:19.400
Really?

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:24.570
My main duty is to find a confession method and help practice it.

00:06:24.570 --> 00:06:25.860
Yeah.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:29.740
And it would be nice if I could go out with her.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.790
That depends on how much effort you put into it.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.140
I'll work hard!

00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:39.950
If you can't talk with her directly, then how about revealing your feelings in a letter?

00:06:39.950 --> 00:06:42.250
You mean a love letter?

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:45.300
It's true that I don't know Mariko-san's email address.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:49.090
So we just have to compose your feelings into a letter.

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:52.760
If you say so then I think I can do it!

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:55.060
Let's work hard together!

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.930
I was attracted to your magnificence.

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.670
And it has to be now!

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:02.160
I want to tell you my feelings!

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.610
It's ready.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.230
You did it.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:06.480
Read it.

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:09.280
Is it all right?

00:07:13.050 --> 00:07:16.120
I think it's a letter that describes your feelings very precisely.

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.330
That's great.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:21.540
But I don't know how I should deliver it.

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.370
I'm sorry for staying so long.

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.360
No problem.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:27.420
Thank you very much for taking care of my son.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:32.470
I'll accompany you tomorrow, so let's both do our best!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:34.640
Thank you.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:42.280
Then go with confidence!

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:43.520
Understood!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:47.510
Please do your best!

00:08:00.060 --> 00:08:01.860
Koga

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.250
m 311 114 l 325 158 365 146 397 137 435 133 459 129 538 140 562 147 567 132 571 126 567 111 569 105 545 96 513 90 478 84 442 85 406 86 371 94 346 100

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:10.250
Mariko-sama's Bodyguards

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:12.620
It's useless.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.780
I even can't give her a letter.

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:17.180
Why am I such a coward?

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:21.750
At this rate, I'll never be able to approach Mariko-san.

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:23.330
I'm so pitiful.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.110
I've got it.

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.790
Shall we call someone who you can rely on?

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:31.910
He possesses the same heart as you,

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:35.950
so I think that he'll understand you and certainly give you some advice.

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:39.370
Is he from the Heavens?

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.370
No.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.160
He's from Earth.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.540
Good evening.

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:48.730
I give up.

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:51.670
The truth is that I also struggle with those kinds of things.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.620
Oh, I'd heard something else entirely.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:59.930
But I worry about the same things, so I can ponder it with you.

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:03.040
I can understand your feelings very well.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:05.040
I-I see.

00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.980
Is that yours?

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.350
Yes. That's right.

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:10.500
I see.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:16.110
{ibdvfk} If you can play the guitar, then why don't you put your feelings into song, and sing it for her as a present?

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.530
Singing in front of people?

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.950
I think it will be easier to tell her your feelings using this method rather than with simple words.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:25.210
If she's in the band then you can appeal to her with your own song.{or attract}

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:28.610
But I've never sung while playing before.

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:33.830
I think she'll be much more moved if you come up with your own song.

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:36.430
But I haven't composed any songs.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.990
It'll be good as long as you don't over complicate things!

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:40.040
What do you think about it?

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:41.640
Let's try this.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:45.460
These are the song lyrics I came up with.

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:51.020
Then recall the tunes of your favorite songs, imitate them, and try to create a melody.

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:58.120
From the moment when I saw you for the first time...

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:01.030
Yeah like this, it's getting better.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:02.920
Next is C, D, G, right?

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:03.700
Yes.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:08.700
I still count those sleepless nights...

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:11.090
Today...

00:10:11.780 --> 00:10:14.740
Okay! I think it's good.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:17.740
But I can't think of the next measures.

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:19.660
Yeah, it's getting hard from this point.

00:10:20.110 --> 00:10:22.510
Hey, could I interject for a moment?

00:10:23.130 --> 00:10:25.680
What about combining this and this?

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:29.540
Like this?

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.730
I see.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:31.980
Nice idea!

00:10:35.150 --> 00:10:37.540
Okay! It's almost finished.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:38.820
Thank you very much!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:42.070
It turned into a good song filled with emotion.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:45.460
But it's a bit embarrassing singing this in front of the people.

00:10:45.460 --> 00:10:49.260
You just have to be careful on the D sharp, concentrate on the song and everything will be fine.

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:52.750
Then maybe you can let Mariko-san hear it tomorrow?

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.240
Tomorrow?

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:55.170
That's too soon!

00:10:55.170 --> 00:11:00.130
I'm sure that your song will reach her heart.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.170
I wonder if it'll reach her...

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:08.600
Don't focus so much on the guitar that you neglect the song.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.810
I'll support you from the shadows.

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:12.050
Yes!

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:14.520
I'll embody everything that I learned yesterday!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:16.090
Good luck.

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:19.210
Stay calm and convey your feelings.

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:20.110
Yes!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:23.000
It'll be nice if he succeeds.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.240
I'm going to go take a look.

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:50.400
Excuse me!

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.350
Who are you?

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:56.370
I'm a second year from class D, Shimano Yuuki.

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:57.980
You want to join the club?

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:58.920
Yes.

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:00.120
No.

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:00.990
Well...

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:04.530
I've composed a song.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:08.160
I'd like you to hear that song, Koga-senpai.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:11.540
Would you mind listening to it for a while?

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.420
Why's that?

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.390
Because I like to play the guitar.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:19.530
All right.

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:25.400
That guy wants to perform a solo?

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:26.520
Dunno.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:30.120
He wants to sing to his own accompaniment?

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:34.990
But judging by that guitar I can tell that he's not any amateur.

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:39.690
Here I go.

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:46.730
From the moment when I saw you for the first time...

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:52.200
My clock stopped.

00:12:53.710 --> 00:13:03.670
I thought that the second hand was captured by you, it was so stuck that it was unable to move.

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:11.380
I still count those sleepless nights...

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:09.180
 Give it your best, Yuuki-san.

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:16.050
And today I am still entwined by those memories.

00:13:16.960 --> 00:13:25.490
Even if I woke up from my dream I'd still be-

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:30.200
What happened?

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:33.370
You can't even play such a simple tune?

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:36.970
From what I can tell it's a love song for someone,

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:40.490
but you've really got guts to play it with your skill level.

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:41.670
Maezano-kun!

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:43.840
I'm sorry.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.680
I'll work on it.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.760
You said way too much!

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.180
Wasn't it just a joke?

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:59.610
He didn't do well, but he practiced a lot.

00:14:03.180 --> 00:14:04.400
How was it?

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.530
I see.

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:29.230
So confession through song was a bad idea...

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:31.720
It went badly because I failed.

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.450
I thought it was a good method.

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:37.810
Had I sang better, the result would've been more preferable.

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:41.190
I'm sure that I haven't conveyed anything.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:44.010
So what if you fail once or twice?!

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:45.670
You should take up the challenge once more!

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:47.960
After such an embarrassing failure?

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:48.900
It's impossible.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:51.430
I'm a loser after all.

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:56.450
I received the name Yuuki from my parents, but I can't obtain anything.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:59.800
I can't play such wonderful music like Mariko-san does.

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:02.330
I don't even know how to pick up a girl.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:06.790
I wanted to form a band to show my cool side, but I even can't play chords properly.

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:09.130
I'm just a coward, heavy metal guy!

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:11.510
That! That's it!

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:15.810
That's it!

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.860
Anger, sadness, worries.

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:22.930
There's no better way to release your frustration than through rock!

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:25.060
Furthermore, if you're willing to try,

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:28.990
you can express your feelings to Mariko-san through her favorite- heavy metal!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:33.160
But you have to form a band to perform heavy metal.

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:36.330
I have an idea.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:40.330
Pardon the intrusion.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.880
I was curious about what you might need, so we went to check...

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:46.960
And on the way there was lottery where we won a guitar.

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.710
We picked up a bass on the street.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:51.880
I helped one person out and he gave me a keyboard.

00:15:51.880 --> 00:15:55.730
I figured out right away that Belldandy's compelling force was working.

00:15:55.730 --> 00:15:57.470
To tell the truth...

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:00.860
So that's how it is.

00:16:00.860 --> 00:16:02.940
So you want us to help too?

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:05.400
I'll do anything for Onee-sama's sake!

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:08.680
Yuuki-kun's future depends on this, so please help us.

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:09.980
Please.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.160
Awesome!

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:13.190
You guys were all in a band, right?

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:15.420
We weren't, but don't worry!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:19.510
If we combine our powers there will be no obstacle we can't overcome.

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:22.060
That's the band's strong point, isn't it?

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:23.330
Is that so?

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.720
Okay!

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:26.740
Let's decide who will be playing what!

00:16:26.740 --> 00:16:30.950
If you want me to participate in this then obviously I want to be the star lead guitarist.

00:16:30.950 --> 00:16:35.100
He's taking the prominent role, so lead guitar and vocals have already been decided.

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:36.140
Then, I won't do it.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:40.090
I want you to take charge of rhythm guitar, Urd.

00:16:40.090 --> 00:16:41.930
But that isn't a leading role.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:46.330
Actually, it's much more indispensable than lead guitar, and is the band's vital point.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:47.440
That's sounds good.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:49.110
You should've said so earlier if it's like that!

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:51.590
And Skuld will take charge of the drums.

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:56.530
It's tiring and savage, and besides you only sit in the back and not stand out, so I don't want to!

00:16:57.110 --> 00:17:01.300
Actually the one who plays the drums is positioned as the band leader!

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:02.660
That sounds good.

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:04.060
I got it.

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:07.040
But I'm doing this only for Onee-sama's sake!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.170
Please take care of it.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:10.160
I'll take care of the bass.

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:12.220
You'll be in charge of keyboard, Belldandy.

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:13.500
I understand.

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:16.090
Somehow being in a band is exciting, isn't it?

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:19.590
Will everything be all right if we work like this?

00:17:19.590 --> 00:17:21.190
It'll all work out somehow!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:22.180
This is rock!

00:17:22.180 --> 00:17:23.120
No!

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:23.980
Metal!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:29.650
We have to turn your song into a heavy metal piece first.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:31.420
Heavy metal?

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.040
Like this?

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:35.670
Awesome.

00:17:35.670 --> 00:17:37.950
Yuuki-kun has the leading role,

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:41.670
so you and Urd have to lead the band as its vital points to the bitter end.

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:43.100
I know!

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:43.740
Hey.

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:46.920
You're very small, and you can be overshadowed by the drums.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:48.320
Can you really play them?

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:50.000
I can!

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:56.400
If I use the Great Skuld Rolling Blast Band I developed, then even playing heavy metal drunk will be easy!

00:17:56.400 --> 00:17:58.010
Switch on!

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:04.720
I feel like I have a good band.

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:05.730
That's right!

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.640
Okay, let's start.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:15.280
We managed to convert your song to metal.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:20.070
But it's kind of unclear who is the core of the established group.

00:18:20.070 --> 00:18:22.830
Obviously it's me!

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:25.920
You should just shut up and follow my lead.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:27.270
What's with you?

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:29.460
I'm the band leader!

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:31.880
But it is fun to be in a band.

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:33.100
Right!

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:36.320
Now that the five of us have gathered we can produce so much power!

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:40.050
Remember that we're all supporting you!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:41.260
Yeah.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:45.180
Okay, that's it for today.

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:46.390
Thank you very much.

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:50.990
I thought about a method to make Mariko-san listen to the current song,

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:55.500
seems that there'll be an empty space during the shopping street festival taking place next week.

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:57.610
What do you think about inviting her there?

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:59.580
It sounds like it'll be large-scale event.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:03.570
Inviting Mariko-san will be difficult, but the stage is ready.

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:05.950
I still don't have any self confidence.

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.700
What're you saying?

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:10.840
Your vital point will be there, so everything will be fine!

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:13.460
I am the band leader!

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.380
Everything will fail without my leading guitar!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:14.650
 Hey! Hey!

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:16.380
 Both of you are awesome!

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:20.360
I'm certain we'll create a wonderful performance.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.880
That's right.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:24.360
This isn't just my case anymore.

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:26.260
I have to do my best so that everything will be fine,

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:30.060
and work up the courage to invite Mariko-san to the festival.

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.350
Yes.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:36.360
No club activities today?

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:40.610
What do you want to talk about?

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:44.150
I was wondering if you were free to catch a movie tomorrow since it's a holiday.

00:19:44.610 --> 00:19:45.850
Tomorrow?

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:49.250
I don't have anything special planned, so I can go with you.

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:52.710
Let's meet on the morning train at 9:50.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.930
Then I'll be waiting for you on the platform.

00:19:54.930 --> 00:19:58.110
I also have something I want to tell you.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:19:59.930
What?

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:01.760
I'll let you know tomorrow.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.570
Don't be late.

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:05.170
I'm not you.

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:07.450
Remember to set your alarm clock.

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:14.940
I'm sure that Maezano-senpai will confess to Mariko-san.

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:18.000
Compared to him I'm...

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.440
Yuuki-san.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:24.030
What will you do about practice?

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:29.180
I'm sure that Mariko-san and that senpai will...

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:32.620
You still haven't told her your feelings, Yuuki-san.

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:38.550
Even if I practice now we still won't make it in time with my and the band's skills.

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:43.220
Putting in great effort to have a good performance may indeed be very important,

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:47.100
but you want to confess your feelings to her, right?

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:50.970
What you can do now is present yourself.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:53.770
I think this is what you have to do.

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:57.330
But I lack practice.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:59.070
I don't have any self confidence.

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:01.780
Can you believe in everyone?

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.450
Isn't that what a band is?

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:07.000
Yeah.

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:09.820
I'll work hard.

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:13.870
You're late!

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:16.650
Who do you think we're practicing for?

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:18.540
I might take over your lead position.

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:20.430
Everyone!

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:27.050
I promise on the good name of the Goddess Assistance Office to fulfill your wish!

00:21:27.830 --> 00:21:29.430
Then let's start.

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:33.350
Let's work hard.

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:56.130
Yuuki-san.

00:21:56.950 --> 00:21:58.380
Yuuki-san.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:04.140
It's almost time.

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:06.170
That's true.

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:08.340
We're ready.

00:22:23.720 --> 00:22:25.100
Mariko-san.

00:22:27.990 --> 00:22:29.360
You're...

00:22:33.600 --> 00:22:35.200
I have a request!

00:22:35.800 --> 00:22:40.640
I showed you my embarrassing side earlier, but this time I've practiced properly with my friends,

00:22:40.640 --> 00:22:43.240
and I turned my feelings into a song.

00:22:44.060 --> 00:22:47.940
That's why I want you to listen to it before the train arrives.

00:22:51.190 --> 00:22:52.680
Hey, you!

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:55.860
Performances without permission are prohibited!

00:22:55.860 --> 00:22:57.100
Withdraw immediately!

00:22:57.100 --> 00:22:58.890
Give us just five minutes!

00:22:58.890 --> 00:22:59.980
Please!

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:01.600
I can't allow that.

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:04.000
You're not the only people here.

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:04.860
That's why-

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:06.530
Please give them some time, officer!

00:23:07.130 --> 00:23:09.000
Wait until the next train arrives.

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:10.060
Please!

00:23:10.060 --> 00:23:11.340
Let them do it.

00:23:11.340 --> 00:23:13.030
This is for the precious youth.

00:23:13.030 --> 00:23:15.200
You can't even give them five minutes?

00:23:15.200 --> 00:23:16.540
Give me a break...

00:23:18.300 --> 00:23:22.540
I'll be going the opposite way to the station to confirm a suspicious person.

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:24.980
Make sure to clean up after yourselves.

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:26.510
Understood?

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:28.630
You only have five minutes.

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:33.180
Please listen.

00:24:53.010 --> 00:24:54.460
What're they doing?

00:24:54.460 --> 00:24:55.050
Wait.

00:25:33.510 --> 00:25:35.520
Nice work! That was awesome!

00:25:36.130 --> 00:25:37.720
Good job.

00:25:37.720 --> 00:25:39.180
You were awesome.

00:25:39.790 --> 00:25:41.390
It was wonderful.

00:25:41.390 --> 00:25:44.520
I'm sure that your feelings reached Mariko-san.

00:25:46.230 --> 00:25:49.240
Please note that the doors are closing.

00:25:49.240 --> 00:25:52.360
I wanted to hear her answer.

00:26:03.060 --> 00:26:06.000
You were cool, heavy metal guy.

00:26:06.860 --> 00:26:07.920
Good!

00:26:07.920 --> 00:26:09.920
Good!

00:26:14.970 --> 00:26:16.110
I see.

00:26:16.110 --> 00:26:19.000
Mariko-san was going to reject him from the start.

00:26:19.000 --> 00:26:19.840
Yes.

00:26:19.840 --> 00:26:22.580
But our efforts have paid off.

00:26:22.580 --> 00:26:25.780
I don't think I would've been able to work so hard on my own.

00:26:25.780 --> 00:26:28.230
Thank you very much!

00:26:28.230 --> 00:26:32.210
Everyone has times when they can't accomplish something alone.

00:26:32.210 --> 00:26:35.650
Even I have cases I can't do without your help.

00:26:35.650 --> 00:26:39.360
But you have Belldandy-san, right?

00:26:39.360 --> 00:26:42.450
She's just like a goddess.

00:26:42.450 --> 00:26:44.740
I think so too.

00:26:45.330 --> 00:26:46.940
Thank you very much!

00:26:52.170 --> 00:26:53.530
Time to eat!

00:26:53.530 --> 00:26:54.420
Thanks for the meal!

00:26:54.420 --> 00:26:57.760
You should say those words of gratitude during the meal.

00:26:57.760 --> 00:27:00.670
To be honest, we came here to ask a favor of you.

00:27:00.670 --> 00:27:05.860
This person fell in love with you and wants us to grant his wish...

00:27:05.860 --> 00:27:07.030
Good evening.

00:27:07.980 --> 00:27:11.220
It was love at first sight when I watched your performance!

00:27:11.220 --> 00:27:12.610
Please go out with me.

00:27:12.610 --> 00:27:17.580
Do something about it, Senpai!
